  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forts&#xe4;ttningsprojekt att ge st&#xf6;d och support till sociala myndigheter i Pskovs oblast. Ett utbildningscenter ska &#xe4;ven etableras i Velikij Luki.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide continued education and training in social work to 90 practitioners and key persons in social administration in Pskov oblast with the overall objective to improve the community-based social service and support to the population.</narrative>
  </description>
